    thinking: "**Generating 3D Pins**\n\nI\'m currently focused on dynamically generating the 3D pins within `ThreeCanvas.tsx`. These pins will be created from the `landmarks` prop and will function as floating, glowing markers with interactive beacons. I\'m storing references to these pins within `landmarkPinsRef`.\n\n\n**Creating Pin Interactivity**\n\nI\'ve moved on to making the 3D pins interactive. I\'m using raycasting to detect clicks on the pins. Currently, I\'m setting up a `THREE.OctahedronGeometry` as the geometry for the pins and associating it to each landmark via a mesh. This allows me to then detect the click position and compare it to the meshes in the 3D scene. I\'m excited to continue to implement the highlight effect.\n\n\n"
