 constructed a net for the tennis and volleyball court, then I added four light pylons using a `CylinderGeometry` and a `MeshStandardMaterial` with offsets and placements, and I added lamp heads using a box geometry and emissive material at the top of each pylon.\n\n\n**Adding Decorative Features**\n\nI\'ve just added the finishing touches to the Villa Ol\303\255mpica complex. I\'ve placed decorative mini entrance palm trees using cylinder and icosahedron geometries, using a light lime pastel material. I also offset and positioned the palms to complete the scene and added four lights around the complex. I verified its correct position using a coordinate check, matching the `monteriaData.ts` position.\n\n\n"
